OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and wet start to the
OL,6,Fday with rain heavy in places,
OL,7,Fespecially over higher ground in the
OL,8,Fnorth. Rain eases a little into the
OL,9,Fafternoon, but it will remain cloudy
OL,10,Fwith further outbreaks of rain at
OL,11,Ftimes.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining rather cloudy and
OL,14,Fdamp overnight, with some further
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain and drizzle,
OL,16,Fespecially over higher ground. Hill
OL,17,Ffog also developing, though it will
OL,18,Fremain mild for many.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
