OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FAny overnight rain becoming
OL,6,Frestricted to western coasts where it
OL,7,Fwill may remain largely cloudy
OL,8,Fthroughout the day. Bright spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping elsewhere, and in any
OL,10,Fbrightness it will feel warm.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,13,Fchangeable as rain returns on Friday.
OL,14,FSaturday likely to be dry and bright,
OL,15,Fbut a spell of rain likely overnight.
OL,16,FBright, breezy and potentially warm on
OL,17,FSunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
